      "text": "nestjs\n\nuseFactory => parametrized \n\ntoday => module   DI\n\nmodule => \n\nDI => Dependency Injection \n== to implement \n\n1- heap hoping => manuallay Injection\n\n2- Delegated\n\n\n   DI registy modes\n       -singletone = one inestance only\n       -scoped = multi talience = user sessions \n       -transite = domain deriven Design\n\n\n         transite == scope and dependecy \n\n         * one instance for each scoped \n\n- all controller singleTone  \n\n** DuckDuckGo = searh browser\n\nNodeJs design pattern = book\n\n=====================================\n\nmoongose \n\n- moongose = ODB object docment model\n                 ORM  want learn about it \n- IOC \n\n- dto = in controller\n==========================\n\n** Module **   \n\nModularity in nest.js   \n\ncore factory => root module \nGraph = objects  مربوطة ب Links\n\n** nestjs Injector \n\nres on runtime of module    \n       \n\n",
